urity with a single click Winner REALM: Reinsurance Eval & Analysis for Megaprojects R.E.A.L.M.: AI-powered risk analysis for mega-projects. Streamlines facultative reinsurance, providing instant insights on complex risks. Winner Speech to Image Converter See what you speak Winner RetainAI - The Intelligent Solution to Keep Your Top Talent RetainAI crafts customized employee retention strategies, empowering companies to minimize turnover, enhance engagement, and retain their top performers. Winner AI Data Analysis with RAPIDS Generate custom, in-depth reports and presentations with full featured tables and visualizations powered by gpu acceleration via RAPIDS cuDF dataframes with cuML models. Winner AI Product Catalog An AI engine to make description about product, search product by image or just describe it. Perfect fit for tailor-made product, pawnshop and ecommerce. Winner VisionTrack - Smart AI Inventory Management System VisionTrack is designed to leverage advanced computer vision and AI technologies to handle and monitor inventory. VisionTrack automates product recognition and stock tracking. Winner video analysis This project demonstrates an end-to-end pipeline for analyzing videos specially survillance videos using vision and text based Llms. Clean It Are you an enterprise owner who wants clean data for analysis? Or are you an analyst who don't want to spend hours on cleaning data? If this sounds like you, don't worry. We have got you covered. TaxoRAG: Unleashing the Power of Taxonomic Intelligence TaxoRAG: Your AI-powered guide to the tree of life. Explore NCBI's vast taxonomy data with instant, accurate answers. From researchers to educators, unlock evolutionary insights with our technology TruSim TruSim redefines AI simulacra with a character that engages live audiences, powered by Workbench to connect with Twitch viewers instantaneously, blurring the line between reality and simulation. SpecSyncAI Say goodbye to confusion and endless research; let Spec Sync AI guide you through choosing the perfect computer parts, tailored to your budget and performance goals! DataWise AI Transform your data management with our AI-powered platform, streamlining collaboration, saving time, and enhancing productivity. Say goodbye to tedious data entry and embrace seamless teamwork. VoiceForge AI Highlighting the idea of forging new, high-performance text-to-speech and language models using NVIDIA's AI Workbench. 1 – 24 of 111 « 1 2 3 4 5 »
