              by liking, sharing, and commenting on them. Filter submissions Sponsor Prizes Most Valuable Feedback Project Category Automotive Manufacturing Healthcare Finance Retail Technology Select one Name Recent Sort AffectLink AffectLink provides real-time multimodal emotion insights for tele-health with HP AI Studio. Uncovers hidden cues via facial, audio, & text analysis, boosting clinician understanding & patient care. Winner Document Analysis Toolset The Document Analysis Toolset uses custom trained vision models to analyze PDF files and extract signatures, detect forgery, show detailed version history, and identify manipulated areas of documents. Winner Mira3D Turn your surroundings into immersive 3D scenes using AI-powered Gaussian splatting Winner Sophia Meet Sophia: Complete AI-powered crypto intelligence platform featuring fine-tuned models, news RAG, trading agents, deep research, daily summaries/podcasts, and hyper-personalized smart chat contexts Winner Codence Codence is an AI agent that turns meeting decisions into enforceable specs by syncing Jira tickets and validating GitLab code against agreed rules. Winner OpenMed A modular AI-driven diagnostic system that intelligently selects specialized models for each case, offering clear, interpretable insights to foster greater trust and transparency in medical AI. Winner Medical Report Analyzer & Healthy Habits Recommender This application provides a simple web interface to generate summaries, health suggestions, and food recommendations from medical documents (PDFs or images) Winner QuantumFinance AI Your AI copilot for the stock market. Get instant analysis, news summaries, and trading strategies to make smarter, faster decisions. Winner TRYON Try before you buy – virtually using GenAI. Our app lets users try on clothes using just their image, all processed locally for complete privacy and instant results. Winner Orpheus Engine The Orpheus Engine Workspace, the AI-powered DAW for audio restoration and analysis, offering seamless cross-device use and diverse plugin support for music, gaming, and data science! Winner KT Assist Understand any codebase in minutes with our AI assistant built on HP AI Studio 3x faster onboarding, real-time code insights, MLFlow tracking, GPU-accelerated explanations, and source-aware responses. MusicMoodMirror, An LLM-powered Emotional Wellness Companion Music Mood Mirror uses your listening history to passively track emotional trends, offering insights from lyrics and genres—especially helpful for those navigating mental health challenges. MedDream: AI-Powered Visualizations for Medical Text MedDream uses generative AI to turn medical text into realistic diagnostic images helping researchers and educators visualize conditions without using real patient data or compromising privacy. Neuron Segmentation A simulation-driven approach to building AI models for neuroscience and microscopy. MedExplain An AI-powered interface that helps users interpret and interact with medical reports and images, using MedGemma for multimodal understanding and MLflow for seamless model deployment Meal adviser Need to change your lifestyle and diet, after getting some health problem?
Tired to find a diet adapted or aligned to your specific problem?  
Try this AI-Powered app based on your Lab results ZEREBRO: The Brain of the Future Factory Dynamic vision agent cobots for dark automotive manufacturing factories, leveraging synthetic sensor data and Reinforcement Learning within NVIDIA Omniverse Digital Twins to achieve robotic autonomy. Mood Mate Many people face mental health challenges on a daily basis but either don't have time or don't have access to therapy. Mood Mate attempts to bridge this gap by providing AI analysis for journaling. Travel Pose Helper An AI-powered web app designed to assist travelers in capturing perfect photo poses using images of their current location and help users to compare their image with the example image. IPFS / webnn Huggingface Bridge I am porting huggingface transformers libraries to webNN, creating a virtual fileystem, and creating a decentralized multi-agent architecture (aka swissknife which is under DMCA strike by Anthropic) QuickCart Semantic appliance search using transformer embeddings Typing Speed Test This is a typing test where the sentences the user has to type are generated by AI. Shop Savvy Suggest Empowering customers with AI for better, smarter shopping. 1 – 23 of 23
