Fetched with `curl`: main pages, galleries ([AWS](https://nvidia-aws.devpost.com/project-gallery), [Dell](https://hackaichallenge.devpost.com/project-gallery), [HP](https://hpaistudio.devpost.com/project-gallery), [UCSC](https://nemoclaw.devpost.com/project-gallery)), and every linked winner below. Project descriptions are self-reported; pages may include post-event updates.

**Legend:** W = NVIDIA AI Workbench; HM = honorable mention; U = NVIDIA technology unspecified **(unverified)**. Prize column lists award titles. **Every “why” and pattern is an inference (unverified), not judges’ feedback.**

